  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level and higher, a theurge can cast two spells he has prepared, one arcane and one divine, using one action. Both of the spells must have the same casting time. The theurge can make any decisions concerning the spells independently of each other. Any target affected by both spells takes a –4 penalty on saving throws against each spell. A theurge receives a +4 bonus on caster level checks made to overcome spell resistance involving either of the two spells. A theurge can use this ability once per day at 5th level and one additional time per day at 11th and 17th levels.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theurge#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
